WEBVTT

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.209
Very well. Begin!

00:02:37.491 --> 00:02:41.086
Mr. Kuryu, I apologize for
calling you on such short notice.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:44.494
However, the gravity of
the situation demands it.

00:02:44.865 --> 00:02:49.530
You are aware of the kingdom of
Karain's decision to withdraw...

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:54.267
...from the UN in protest of the
creation of the new UN Troops.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:58.277
Six hours ago, the military of
Karain entered into a state...

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:02.337
...of unrestricted war with the
defense forces of its neighbors.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:07.008
As you see, Karain is bordered
by desert on three sides...

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.179
...while the fourth
encloses a deep gulf.

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:11.690
The desert sand is
highly magnetic.

00:03:11.792 --> 00:03:13.851
This renders modern
weaponry useless...

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.452
...and makes a seacoast invasion
our only viable option.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:21.089
Two hours ago, a force of
three UNT gunships managed to...

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:23.670
...penetrate the Gulf
and obtain video of...

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:27.104
...a mysterious superweapon
we've been receiving reports of.

00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:32.778
The video we managed to pull
off the satellite uplink...

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:35.814
...showed a new weapon
on which we have no data.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:41.487
Judging from the battle details,
we've extrapolated that...

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:46.458
...it's faster and more destructive
than our latest F-30 fighters.

00:03:47.027 --> 00:03:50.861
The carrier Alexandria is
currently off the coast of Japan...

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:54.628
...on its way to the battlezone
to support the UNT forces.

00:03:54.935 --> 00:03:57.836
Mr. Chairman, I'd like
the Kuryu Group's help...

00:03:57.938 --> 00:04:00.737
...to ensure this crisis ends
with victory for our side.

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:06.571
Very well.

00:04:24.698 --> 00:04:28.726
Ferrying these clowns around...
Are they serious?!

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:35.298
The brass don't think we can
win without Kuryu's new weapon.

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:39.538
The President's always talking
about reducing arms in the world.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:41.910
We shouldn't have anything to
do with these death merchants!

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:46.213
Secure that talk, Mister!
They might hear you...

00:04:47.087 --> 00:04:49.249
Get those crates
set up ASAP!

00:04:49.356 --> 00:04:51.415
We don't have much time
till the test tomorrow.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.327
God damn,
this thing's big...

00:05:08.642 --> 00:05:10.701
We're training now!
Get that off the deck!

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.369
Alright, I'm moving.

00:05:32.399 --> 00:05:34.493
Ellis, what's wrong?

00:05:34.601 --> 00:05:36.535
Pull up!

00:05:38.605 --> 00:05:40.039
Ellis, calm down!

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.936
Children...
There're children in here!

00:05:43.043 --> 00:05:43.669
What?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:48.509
Children in the cockpit...
They're holding my hands down!

00:05:51.952 --> 00:05:56.014
It's been 12 hours
since Karain's invasion...

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:59.023
...and supplies from at least
one Japanese corporation are...

00:05:59.125 --> 00:06:02.117
...being sent to support
soldiers on the front line.

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:06.461
Defense Dept. Spokesman Jim Kelly
issued the following statement:

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.566
I wish you guys would learn
to be a little more careful.

00:06:12.005 --> 00:06:14.633
That does it...
Okay, who's next?

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:17.869
God is always watching
over all of you.

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:21.179
You must all come
to realize that!

00:06:21.748 --> 00:06:25.651
We have always done our part
to work for world order.

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:29.188
However, there come
times when we must...

00:06:29.289 --> 00:06:32.657
...take the long view of things,
and make difficult decisions.

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:34.591
We must believe in victory...

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:38.460
A victory for all those
who pray for peace!

00:06:41.935 --> 00:06:46.839
His Vajra power level's been
spiking ever since he got here.

00:06:47.741 --> 00:06:51.109
Relax. He's just a little
nervous before his big debut.

00:06:51.378 --> 00:06:54.006
This monster?

00:07:09.496 --> 00:07:14.366
I'd been groping for the answer...
How to create the perfect pilot.

00:07:19.739 --> 00:07:22.800
In hooking a human subject
up to a PSI-scanner...

00:07:22.909 --> 00:07:26.345
...we can clearly see all sorts
of images and shadows displayed.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:28.642
This is known as the
"mind shadow".

00:07:28.748 --> 00:07:32.343
Within this shadow lies a
still unexplored universe.

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:36.980
What we call the "life force" blows
through this inner cosmos like a wind.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.582
I have chosen to
call this wind "Vajra".

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:42.821
This device, the "Mandala",
will amplify the mind shadow...

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:46.092
...increasing the Vajra
component to infinity.

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:49.334
It's finished, Kenneth!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.674
Our Mandala!

00:07:58.044 --> 00:08:00.945
No matter how you improve
weaponry, you're limited...

00:08:01.047 --> 00:08:03.516
...by what stresses the
pilot's body can withstand.

00:08:03.616 --> 00:08:06.813
So why not try making
a better pilot?

00:08:08.455 --> 00:08:11.015
That's what the
Vajranoid represents.

00:08:14.661 --> 00:08:17.392
By breaking down
its body by means of...

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.692
<i>"Nana energy from
Morgans “inner cosmos“...</i>

00:08:19.799 --> 00:08:22.268
...it can fuse with any
internal engine system...

00:08:22.368 --> 00:08:24.166
...and achieve 100% control!

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:52.424
Altitude 1000 meters
and climbing.

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:56.658
2000... 3000...
5000 meters and holding.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.498
Isn't this a bit dangerous?

00:09:00.874 --> 00:09:03.104
The real show is yet to come.

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:05.837
This isn't like any
other type of piloting.

00:09:05.945 --> 00:09:08.209
Pilot and plane are now one!

00:09:08.314 --> 00:09:12.547
I've created what Morgan couldn't...
A true Vajra warrior!

00:09:21.694 --> 00:09:24.391
Mr. Sakomizu! The Vajranoid's
behavior is becoming erratic.

00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:33.971
It's flying off course.

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:35.541
Impossible...

00:09:35.642 --> 00:09:37.406
What's going on, Sakomizu?!

00:09:37.744 --> 00:09:39.644
That's enough, Mister!

00:09:39.746 --> 00:09:41.043
But sir...!

00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:43.041
What?

00:09:43.149 --> 00:09:45.584
Sir, we're receiving an SOS.

00:09:46.252 --> 00:09:48.687
This is a UNN observation plane.

00:09:48.788 --> 00:09:53.021
I was attacked while
surveying a Karain battlezone.

00:09:53.126 --> 00:09:56.289
I'm carrying a wounded civilian and
request emergency landing clearance!

00:09:56.396 --> 00:09:58.922
Right, clear him for landing!

00:09:59.032 --> 00:10:00.830
And have emergency teams
standing by on the flight deck!

00:10:00.934 --> 00:10:01.730
Aye, aye!

00:10:05.772 --> 00:10:09.072
Sir! The F-30's pursuing
the UNN plane!

00:10:09.842 --> 00:10:12.106
Diving fast
from 10,000 meters!

00:10:52.785 --> 00:10:55.811
You goddamn Jap!
What have you done?!

00:10:58.725 --> 00:11:01.285
You dirty butcher!
I want you off this ship!

00:11:04.731 --> 00:11:06.893
How could you
disgrace me like that?

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.695
Wake up, you freak!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.331
You can't survive
outside of that suit...

00:11:13.439 --> 00:11:17.535
...meaning you live
or die on my say-so.

00:11:17.644 --> 00:11:20.170
And now you want to start
playing games with me?!

00:11:20.713 --> 00:11:23.910
Why did you attack that plane?
Answer me!

00:11:27.687 --> 00:11:30.588
DANGEROUS POWER.

00:11:31.391 --> 00:11:32.415
What?

00:11:33.359 --> 00:11:38.991
HAD TO ATTACK OR
WOULD HAVE BEEN DESTROYED.

00:12:06.993 --> 00:12:11.260
Are you guys staying there to
ask her for a date or something?

00:12:12.332 --> 00:12:14.630
Is this cyber-body of hers
really that strange to you?

00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:19.031
She's doing her best
to live, in spite of it.

00:12:19.138 --> 00:12:23.700
You know you'll see people lose body
parts in battle. When that happens--

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.006
When that happens,
it'll happen.

00:12:26.112 --> 00:12:29.707
Thing is, that body doesn't
look very complete.

00:12:29.816 --> 00:12:33.753
Yeah. Say Doc, you think
she's some sorta sex doll...

00:12:33.853 --> 00:12:36.879
...for those dickless wonders
in the Karaini army?

00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:38.582
Ooh, good one!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.486
Of all the filthy--!

00:12:42.662 --> 00:12:44.426
You son of a bitch!

00:12:48.301 --> 00:12:49.063
What the hell?!

00:12:52.638 --> 00:12:54.231
You just... How?!

00:12:54.974 --> 00:12:56.942
All dead...

00:12:58.111 --> 00:13:00.170
You...
You spoke!

00:13:01.147 --> 00:13:03.775
We were playing together...

00:13:05.485 --> 00:13:08.785
Hot light...killed them all...

00:13:10.323 --> 00:13:15.090
This girl... She's talking to me!
Don't you hear her?

00:13:20.333 --> 00:13:23.303
All dead...and then...

00:13:25.838 --> 00:13:26.669
More dead...

00:13:27.507 --> 00:13:29.805
You must have seen
some horrible things.

00:13:31.778 --> 00:13:32.745
You did, didn't you?

00:13:33.346 --> 00:13:36.577
But you don't have to worry
about anything else now.

00:13:36.949 --> 00:13:39.577
Whatever happens,
I'll take care of you.

00:15:03.769 --> 00:15:05.168
Whoa there, young lady.

00:15:05.805 --> 00:15:07.933
Don't go running
too far, Laura.

00:15:08.441 --> 00:15:12.275
A little gal like you could be
hard to find if you get lost.

00:15:15.781 --> 00:15:19.718
Have you heard?
Laura's some sorta telepath.

00:15:19.819 --> 00:15:22.345
But she only talks
to Myra, right?

00:15:23.089 --> 00:15:25.421
It's probably just
her imagination.

00:15:25.525 --> 00:15:28.859
Can't blame her, considering how
she just lost her own daughter.

00:15:28.961 --> 00:15:30.122
I see.

00:15:30.229 --> 00:15:32.561
"Laura" was her
real daughter's name...

00:15:32.665 --> 00:15:34.656
...and she was
around this girl's age.

00:15:34.767 --> 00:15:36.758
She died in
an airline crash.

00:15:36.869 --> 00:15:40.499
And now Myra's calling
her by her daughter's name.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.588
Oh yes... It's time for
Laura to take her medicine.

00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:16.540
Doctor.

00:16:17.743 --> 00:16:19.302
Oh, hello Father.

00:16:19.412 --> 00:16:23.679
I didn't mean to startle you.
Are you looking for someone?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.411
Yes.

00:16:25.518 --> 00:16:29.421
If it's Laura, I saw her
playing in section four.

00:16:29.522 --> 00:16:30.887
Thank you, Father.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.351
I refuse!

00:16:32.892 --> 00:16:35.953
No one said anything about
you prying into my research!

00:16:36.362 --> 00:16:38.831
After what happened
during the test...

00:16:38.931 --> 00:16:42.424
...it's my duty to make sure your
research won't endanger this ship!

00:16:43.536 --> 00:16:45.334
Now, will you
let me inspect it'?

00:16:48.307 --> 00:16:51.333
Laura!
Laura, where are you?

00:16:52.211 --> 00:16:54.179
Where did she get to?

00:17:21.941 --> 00:17:23.534
<i>Stay away from me'.!</i>

00:17:28.814 --> 00:17:31.374
Stop it!
Don't be stupid!

00:17:31.484 --> 00:17:32.849
Keep aWaY!

00:17:32.952 --> 00:17:37.617
The Devil's on this ship, and
he's going to take us all to hell!

00:18:24.236 --> 00:18:28.036
I'm not Iettin' him take me...
Are you'?

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:28.971
Don't!

00:18:33.245 --> 00:18:35.043
Who're you?! How long
have you been in here?

00:18:37.416 --> 00:18:38.042
Wham'?!

00:18:38.484 --> 00:18:40.452
I won't go!

00:18:47.493 --> 00:18:50.292
Captain, get out on deck!
Something's happened!

00:18:52.898 --> 00:18:54.059
Laura!

00:18:58.938 --> 00:19:00.428
No!
Stay in there!

00:19:04.577 --> 00:19:06.170
God dammit...

00:19:06.278 --> 00:19:08.246
Stop it! No!!!

00:19:09.815 --> 00:19:10.543
No...

00:19:11.417 --> 00:19:12.851
No answer from storage.

00:19:12.952 --> 00:19:14.886
Alright, we'll check
it out ourselves.

00:19:31.437 --> 00:19:32.063
What's wrong?!

00:19:32.304 --> 00:19:34.568
Something on board's
generating a massive power surge!

00:19:35.641 --> 00:19:37.075
LAURA!!!

00:19:59.698 --> 00:20:03.225
Genocyber: Cyber Monster from
the Imaginary World. Next stage:

00:20:03.335 --> 00:20:06.270
The lost angel, "Laura", has
become Genocyber, and the...

00:20:06.672 --> 00:20:09.266
...Alexandria is plunged into
terror as the huge carrier becomes...

00:20:09.375 --> 00:20:11.309
...a battlefield for
the two cyber monsters.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:14.573
Genocyber vs. the Vajranoid.
The bell for round two has rung!

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:17.843
A bell which tolls the
collapse of all humanity...

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.317
...in a fierce battle which will
reveal the true heart of man.

00:20:20.419 --> 00:20:24.253
Super Cult Animation
"Genocyber, Part 3:"

00:20:24.356 --> 00:20:26.950
"Vajranoid Showdown!"
Act Two

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:29.221
The seal has now been broken...

00:20:39.071 --> 00:20:44.271
True love always seems
to be passing me by.

00:20:44.376 --> 00:20:51.282
Happiness for me never
seems to last too long.

00:20:51.383 --> 00:20:56.685
But when I gather all
my stardust tears together...

00:20:56.789 --> 00:21:02.250
I think of all the good times,
and long for the moon above...

00:21:03.095 --> 00:21:11.095
A cool breeze blows down...
To me!

00:21:15.374 --> 00:21:20.972
Rather than just staying here...

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:27.417
...maybe I should try
my hand at love.

00:21:27.519 --> 00:21:33.219
'Cause they say
that nobody at all...

00:21:33.325 --> 00:21:40.994
...can know what
tomorrow holds.

00:21:56.815 --> 00:22:01.514
And so I wipe these tears
away from my eyes...

00:22:02.554 --> 00:22:08.960
...because I want them
to see me smile.

00:22:09.061 --> 00:22:14.022
All I do is
think of yesterday...

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:21.306
...and how beautiful
it all was.

00:22:21.407 --> 00:22:26.971
Rather than just staying here...

00:22:27.079 --> 00:22:33.678
...maybe I should try
and risk the pain.

00:22:33.786 --> 00:22:39.247
I'm stronger than
anyone else I know...

00:22:39.358 --> 00:22:42.358
And so, no matter what,
I know I will survive.
